  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The output from a NAND gate having inputs A and B given below will be,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/61e57134-4166-43d4-9e92-f5121d1d1159.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
